// Sagebrush: the sage hills' cover - a low, rounded, grey shrub, a few gnarled stems twisting up from
// one root under a soft cloud of small, silver-grey leaves, open enough to see the stems through.
// It grows everywhere, a step or two apart, so the hills read silver from afar.
